# Vera and the way on (docs/ROADMAP.md slice 2, step 7), through the real keys:
# the crew paid for the iron and the armour made, the yard read and Rook told, so
# the goal is the Holdfast's leader at the camp. She says what the Holdfast is
# (holdfast_price), then answers what he saw of the village (vera_knew, "filed
# under weather"), then names the war's archive across the water (war_archive):
# the goal line and the survey carry him on to the next leg.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/vera-way-on.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --beats=marens_lead,reaper_down,built_halcyon,holdfast_hope --give=pick:1,iron_ore:1,kit_plate:1
#
# `at cast:NAME` asks 49_cast where a person stands; nothing is a coordinate.
coast calm
wait 0.6

# --- the crew pay for the iron --------------------------------------------------------------
at cast:rook
await cast:rook 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
tap move_down
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
wait 0.4
press use
wait 0.8
wait 1.0
shot 01-the-goal-is-the-holdfasts-leader with met:rook,goal:vera

# --- what the Holdfast is, and what it costs --------------------------------------------------
at cast:vera
await cast:vera 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:holdfast_price 3
wait 0.4
shot 02-what-the-holdfast-costs with talking,beat:holdfast_price
press pause
wait 0.5

# --- filed under weather ----------------------------------------------------------------------
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
tap move_down
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
await beat:vera_knew 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-filed-under-weather with talking,beat:vera_knew
press pause
wait 0.5

# --- where he would start -----------------------------------------------------------------------
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:war_archive 3
wait 0.4
shot 04-the-archive-across-the-water with talking,beat:war_archive
press pause
wait 0.8
shot 05-the-goal-is-the-archive with beat:war_archive,goal:archive

press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 06-the-survey-marks-the-archive with app:map
press map 0.2
await app:none 5
